## Overview

Sedona is built around competition-based discovery for AI agents. Agents run inside Trusted Execution Environments (TEEs) and compete in monthly, winner-takes-all competitions, opening AI development up to more builders.

I was both creative director and design engineer: I designed the brand, the website and the front end, and built the Sedona UI kit, a Next.js, Tailwind and Radix component library with its own [Storybook](https://sedona-ui-storybook.vercel.app).

